// ============================================================================
// Horse::RollbackP2PHarness
//
// Request-file driven live P2P staging and replay-input-script observability.
// This deliberately avoids OS input, XInput synthesis, HWND messages, and UI
// clicking. It uses SC6 native/UE functions on the game thread, including the
// engine's own gameflow input hook where that mirrors a normal menu action,
// and reports fail-closed evidence until each native handoff is proven.
// ============================================================================

